Package: apbCatalogR
Title: Look Up APB Result Fields by Meaning
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Witold E.", "Wolski", , "witold.wolski@fgcz.uzh.ch", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6468-120X")),
    person("Witek", "Wolski", , "wewolski@gmail.com", role = "cre"),
    person("Functional Genomics Center Zurich", role = "fnd"))
Description: Looks up the fields of AnnData Proteomics Bridge (APB) results
    by meaning, such as a PEP or an unnormalized intensity, without naming
    vendor columns. Reimplements the apb-catalog API on the bundle apb-catalog
    releases: reviewed catalogues, apb2's rule levels and expected answers.
    Reads APB results, as h5ad, Parquet or DuckDB, into anndataR objects.
